{\b AgentFlow}\par
\par
AgentFlow is a desktop frontend that runs multi-stage workflows (plan, develop, review, refine) through the Claude Code command-line tool.\par
\par
{\b Before you use it}\par
\bullet  AgentFlow does not include Claude Code. Install Claude Code from Anthropic separately and sign in with your own account (run {\f0 claude auth login} in a terminal).\par
\bullet  AgentFlow never signs you in, and never reads or stores your Claude credentials. Your use of Claude Code is billed to your own Claude plan or API key and is subject to Anthropic's terms.\par
\bullet  Claude Code can read, change and run code in the project folders you add. Only add folders whose contents you trust.\par
\par
{\b Your data}\par
Chats and workflow runs are stored on this computer in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\AgentFlow. Workflows are stored in %APPDATA%\\AgentFlow\\workflows. Uninstalling AgentFlow leaves both in place.\par
\par
AgentFlow is not made by, endorsed by or affiliated with Anthropic.\par
